<h3>🚚 Carriers Verification</h3>
<div id="carrierAdminList" style="font-size:11px"></div>
</div>

<div class="card">
<h3>🔧 Quick Actions</h3>
<button class="gold" onclick="giveFreeWeekToAll()">Give 1 Free Week to ALL Users (Promo)</button>
<button style="background:#fff;color:#000" onclick="increaseCommission()">Increase Commission +5 ZiG (10→15→20)</button>
<button class="red" onclick="resetApp()">⚠️ Reset Whole App (Delete All Jobs)</button>
